    { "id": "h6", "type": "text", "x": 480, "y": 800, "width": 320, "height": 90, "color": "1", "text": "**❌ H6**: ζ-fiber descent to Ξ_BC\n**FORECLOSED (V-NC, ledger-relative)**" },

    { "id": "ng_vnc", "type": "text", "x": 840, "y": 800, "width": 340, "height": 110, "color": "1", "text": "**NO-GO: V-NC**\nHecke fiber at K=Q, χ=trivial\nNON-COMPARABLE to Burnol/Sonine\nunder inherited records" },

    { "id": "a_g1", "type": "text", "x": -1610, "y": 560, "width": 250, "height": 80, "color": "4", "text": "**G1: A_η/K_η declared ✓**\nframework_defined" },
    { "id": "xi_bw", "type": "text", "x": -1330, "y": 560, "width": 290, "height": 90, "color": "5", "text": "**Ξ_BW = P_η · W_ℓ* · W_ℓ · P_η**\n*conditional residual under the G2–G5 bridge*" },
    { "id": "a_g2_g5", "type": "text", "x": -1330, "y": 680, "width": 290, "height": 110, "color": "3", "text": "**G2–G5 split bridge theorem**\nσ_B, normal form,\nlower-faithfulness, K_ℓ ∈ K\n*open external*" },

    { "id": "b_strat", "type": "text", "x": -1060, "y": 560, "width": 270, "height": 90, "color": "4", "text": "**D1–D4 per-zero stratification ✓**\nH_η = ⊕_ρ H_{η,ρ}" },
    { "id": "b_sub", "type": "text", "x": -770, "y": 560, "width": 300, "height": 110, "color": "5", "text": "**Ξ_matrix_source**\nfinite-carrier diagnostic\n**INDETERMINATE**\nRho_fin = {ρ_1, ρ_2, ρ_3}" },
    { "id": "b_dorm", "type": "text", "x": -920, "y": 720, "width": 320, "height": 90, "text": "*dormants:*\nΞ_coupling · Ξ_summability · Ξ_orth" },

    { "id": "xi_cp", "type": "text", "x": -480, "y": 540, "width": 290, "height": 90, "color": "5", "text": "**Ξ_cP_shifted_ℓ**\nBranch C child residual\n(shifted co-Poisson route)" },
    { "id": "cp_red", "type": "text", "x": -480, "y": 660, "width": 290, "height": 100, "color": "5", "text": "**CP-RED_{ℓ,a}**\nalgebraic membership gap\nshifted exact factorization" },
    { "id": "zicov", "type": "text", "x": -510, "y": 800, "width": 320, "height": 120, "color": "5", "text": "**ZI-COV^CP**\n(i) P_∞ · M_ζ G = M_ζ · A_∞ G\n(ii) T_a · P_∞ · M_ζ H = M_ζ · A_{T,a} H" },
    { "id": "zicov_i_proved", "type": "text", "x": -740, "y": 970, "width": 360, "height": 140, "color": "4", "text": "**✅ ZI-COV(i) PROVED on Ω**\n(zero-free output subclass)\nA_∞^Ω = M_{1/ζ} · P_∞ · M_ζ\n*NOT target-equivalent under inherited records*" },
    { "id": "zicov_ii", "type": "text", "x": -340, "y": 990, "width": 220, "height": 80, "color": "5", "text": "**ZI-COV(ii) open**" },
    { "id": "jet_surj", "type": "text", "x": -570, "y": 1150, "width": 360, "height": 140, "color": "5", "text": "**projected zero-jet gate for P_∞**\n5-route structural reduction to L_{ρ,k}\n*step 173: K_∞^op operational identity supplied*\n*step 175: L_{ρ_1,0}(G_*) numerically nonzero → full-carrier annihilation FAILS for this G_*, ρ_1*" },
    { "id": "kinf_op", "type": "text", "x": -1000, "y": 1310, "width": 360, "height": 140, "color": "4", "text": "**✅ K_∞^op operational identity (step 173)**\nS_λ via two-projection / PSWF diagonalization\nK_∞^op(s,s') = δ − sin(λΔτ)/(πΔτ) − Σ_n Ψ_n Ψ_n*\n*classical Slepian–Pollak diagonalization invoked*" },
    { "id": "l_numeric", "type": "text", "x": -1000, "y": 1500, "width": 380, "height": 160, "color": "4", "text": "**✅ L_{ρ_1,0}(G_*) NUMERICAL (steps 174-175)**\n= 0.12147 − 0.08986i ± 1.96e−4\n|L| ≥ 0.15089 (750× error)\n*G_*: 3-bump combo on [1,4]; λ=1*\n*concrete obstruction to full ZI-COV(i)*\n*modulo U_∞ normalization caveat*" },
    { "id": "branch_c_nogo", "type": "text", "x": -500, "y": 1690, "width": 380, "height": 160, "color": "1", "text": "**❌ Branch C full-carrier FORECLOSED (step 176)**\nfull ZI-COV(i) FAILS on inherited carrier\n3 confirmation data points (ρ_1, ρ_2, ρ_3 × G_*, G'_*)\nall |L| ≥ 0.11 (>500× error)\n*7th retained no-go; step 170 subclass remains valid*" },
    { "id": "branch_b_attack", "type": "text", "x": -1050, "y": 1690, "width": 360, "height": 160, "color": "5", "text": "**Branch B SL164.1 attack (step 177)**\noperational formula derived for `P kappa_w`:\n  `(P κ_w)(τ) = κ_w(τ) − sinc * κ_w − Σ_n Ψ_n ⟨κ_w, Ψ_n⟩`\n*c_ij blocked at sharpened missing record:*\n*κ_{a,w} = T_a^* K_a^Γ(·,w) — not supplied by inherited*" },
    { "id": "kappa_derive", "type": "text", "x": -1500, "y": 1870, "width": 360, "height": 160, "color": "5", "text": "**κ_{a,w} derivation attempted (step 178)**\nhybrid A/B/C all blocked on:\n`P_{L_a^Γ} K_a^{Γ,amb}` (Burnol's Bessel/Hankel resolvent)\n*V_kappa_classical_theorem_needed*\n*ambient K_a^{Γ,amb}(s,w) supplied, projection is*\n*the named-external classical theorem*" },
    { "id": "branch_a_attack", "type": "text", "x": -1900, "y": 1690, "width": 360, "height": 160, "color": "5", "text": "**Branch A G2-G5 attack (step 179)**\n4 vectors T2a/T2b/T2c/T2d all blocked\nat the SAME κ classical-theorem gap\n*V_branch_a_stuck_at_kappa*\n*K_∞^op insufficient; P_η projection needs κ_{a,ρ,k}*" },
    { "id": "ctmt_instances", "type": "text", "x": -200, "y": 1870, "width": 420, "height": 220, "color": "6", "text": "**✅ CTMT FORMALIZED (step 180)**\nCarrier-Typed Matrix-Element Terminality\nfoundational typed condition with 4 instances:\n  (A) Branch A Calkin → κ (CTMT-stuck)\n  (B) Branch B SL164.1 → κ (CTMT-stuck)\n  (C) Branch C L_{ρ,k} → CTMT-foreclosed-numerical\n  (H6) Hecke → CTMT-bridge-failure\nconsequence theorem: 3 typed outcomes per instance\n*corpus-inclusion candidate flagged (anti_loc/CTMT.md)*" },
    { "id": "de_branges_attack", "type": "text", "x": 1400, "y": 1870, "width": 380, "height": 180, "color": "1", "text": "**❌ de Branges carrier TARGET-EQUIVALENT (step 181)**\nclosure of Xi_dB ↔ classical de Branges RH program\nConrey-Li 2000 survival obstruction\n*not a CTMT instance — obstruction before M-family*\n*8th retained no-go added*\n*V_dB_target_equivalent*" },
    { "id": "hp_attack", "type": "text", "x": 1400, "y": 2080, "width": 380, "height": 180, "color": "1", "text": "**❌ HP / Berry-Keating META-PATTERN CONFIRMED (step 182)**\nH_xp on L²(ℝ_+) self-adjoint with continuous spectrum ℝ\nU(1) extensions: arithmetic spectra (2πn+θ)/L ≠ {γ_n}\nmodified BK = target-equivalent\n*V_HP_meta_pattern_confirmed; 9th no-go*\n*3 classical-RH carriers all end in typed no-go*" },
    { "id": "crc_taxonomy", "type": "text", "x": -200, "y": 2150, "width": 420, "height": 220, "color": "6", "text": "**✅ CRCFT FORMALIZED (step 183)**\nClassical-RH Carrier Foreclosure Taxonomy\n3 modes / 7 instances / 4 carriers:\n  • CTMT (post-reduction matrix-element)\n  • TE (target-equivalence, pre-reduction)\n  • BF (carrier-comparison / wrong spectrum)\n+ coverage conjecture (conjectural)\n*candidate foundational typed condition*\n*CTMT is one mode within CRCFT*" },
    { "id": "connes_attack", "type": "text", "x": 1900, "y": 1870, "width": 380, "height": 180, "color": "1", "text": "**❌ Connes adelic / NCG → CRCFT-TE (step 184)**\nXi_Connes = Tr - E_arith trace defect\nfull closure target-equivalent to Connes 1999\n*V_connes_CRCFT_TE; 10th no-go*\n*CRCFT coverage: 5 carriers / 8+ instances*" },
    { "id": "selberg_attack", "type": "text", "x": 1900, "y": 2080, "width": 380, "height": 180, "color": "4", "text": "**✅ Selberg/Maass CLOSES (step 185)**\nXi_Γ = 0 natively via full Selberg trace ledger\nnot_CRE | CRCFT does_not_apply\n*CRE constraint precisely load-bearing*\n*framework's FIRST POSITIVE closure in this arc*" },
    { "id": "weil_deligne_attack", "type": "text", "x": 1900, "y": 2290, "width": 380, "height": 180, "color": "4", "text": "**✅ Function-field RH CLOSES (step 186)**\nXi_WD = 0 by Deligne purity / Weil II\nGrothendieck-Lefschetz trace + cohomological factorization\nnot_CRE | CRCFT does_not_apply\n*2nd non-CRE closure; dichotomy pattern strengthens*" },
    { "id": "dichotomy_synth", "type": "text", "x": 1400, "y": 2480, "width": 480, "height": 200, "color": "6", "text": "**✅ Framework RH-Carrier Dichotomy Theorem (step 187)**\n4th foundational typed condition formalized\n7 instances: 5 CRE → CRCFT + 2 non-CRE → native closure\n+ coverage conjecture (conjectural)\nCTMT ⊂ CRCFT ⊂ Dichotomy hierarchy\n*corpus-inclusion candidate flagged*" },
    { "id": "rmt_attack", "type": "text", "x": 1900, "y": 2500, "width": 380, "height": 180, "color": "3", "text": "**◇ RMT outside Dichotomy scope (step 188)**\nstatistical evidence carrier, not closure carrier\n*V_RMT_outside_dichotomy_scope*\nDichotomy domain sharpened to *RH-analogous closure carriers*\ncoverage unchanged at 7/7" },
    { "id": "bridge_imp_corollary", "type": "text", "x": -700, "y": 2150, "width": 460, "height": 220, "color": "4", "text": "**✅ Framework Bridge Impossibility Corollary (step 189)**\nnon-CRE C + bridge B → composite C+B is CRE → CRCFT\n*B is TE under minimal/exact bridge condition*\n*general bridge: TE/CTMT/BF*\n*V_corollary_partial*\n*Selberg + Weil-Deligne specializations documented*\n*Path 1: resolve CRCFT-stuck; Path 2: foreclosed; Path 3: refuter*" },
    { "id": "iwasawa_attack", "type": "text", "x": 1900, "y": 2700, "width": 380, "height": 180, "color": "4", "text": "**✅ Iwasawa Main Conj CLOSES (step 190)**\nXi_IW^χ = 0 via Mazur-Wiles 1984\nWiles 1990 + Skinner-Urban 2014 extensions\nnot_CRE | CRCFT does_not_apply\n*3rd non-CRE closure; Dichotomy at 3+5=8 instances*" },
    { "id": "burnol_lit_audit", "type": "text", "x": -1500, "y": 2240, "width": 380, "height": 220, "color": "3", "text": "**◇ Burnol κ literature audit (step 191)**\n7 Burnol papers + 6 adjacent classical surveyed\nclosest candidate: Burnol 2006/2008 scattering paper\n(arxiv:math/0602425) — J_0 Fredholm + RKHS resolvent\n*V_kappa_partial_source_found*\n*Path 1 partially_clarified, not unlocked*" },
    { "id": "burnol_extract", "type": "text", "x": -1500, "y": 2480, "width": 380, "height": 200, "color": "1", "text": "**❌ Burnol 2006/2008 specialization FAILS (step 192)**\nJ_0 Hankel vs Fourier-cosine/zeta-completed mismatch\nFredholm resolvent ≠ orthogonal projection\na=1/2 doesn't remove gamma normalization gap\n*V_burnol_2006_specialization_fails*\n*Path 1 still_blocked_refined*" },
    { "id": "beurling_nyman", "type": "text", "x": 1900, "y": 2890, "width": 380, "height": 200, "color": "1", "text": "**❌ Beurling-Nyman → CRCFT-TE (step 193)**\nXi_BN = (I - P_M)1; δ_A² = 1 - b_A^* G_A^† b_A\nGram entries computable; infinite closure = RH-equiv\n*V_BN_CRCFT_TE; 6th CRE instance*\n*Dichotomy at 6+3+1 = 10 total instances*" },
    { "id": "bn_numerical", "type": "text", "x": 1400, "y": 2700, "width": 380, "height": 160, "color": "4", "text": "**✅ BN Gram numerical experiment (steps 194-195,199)**\nfinite δ_A² harmonic chain extended to N=2000\nδ² log(N) ≈ 0.045\n*concrete data parallel to step 175 L_{ρ,k}*" },
    { "id": "l_rk", "type": "text", "x": -570, "y": 1310, "width": 360, "height": 110, "color": "5", "text": "**L_{ρ,k}(G) = ⟨M_ζ G, P_∞ · y_{ρ,k}⟩**\nterminal matrix-element family\n(pairing identity, step 171)" },
    { "id": "cascade_thm", "type": "text", "x": -740, "y": 1460, "width": 380, "height": 130, "color": "4", "text": "**✅ Cascade Reduction Theorem (Branch C)**\nclosure via shifted co-Poisson route\nreduces to deciding {L_{ρ,k}} or one of the\nthree Branch C external gates\n*under inherited records*" },
    { "id": "ctmt", "type": "text", "x": -330, "y": 1460, "width": 320, "height": 110, "color": "6", "text": "**Carrier-Typed Matrix-Element Terminality (CTMT)**\ncandidate foundational typed condition\n*pending corpus inclusion*" },

    { "id": "f1", "type": "text", "x": -1500, "y": 1720, "width": 280, "height": 130, "color": "3", "text": "**FRONTIER 1** — Branch A (G2–G5)\nCalkin bridge interface on A_η/K_η\n*completes the route toward its targeted compact/tail implication; closure follows only through that conditional*" },
    { "id": "f2", "type": "text", "x": -1080, "y": 1720, "width": 280, "height": 130, "color": "3", "text": "**FRONTIER 2** — Branch B (SL164.1)\nprojected Sonine kernel entries\n*decides Branch B finite-carrier diagnostic or activates next residual*" },
    { "id": "f3", "type": "text", "x": -660, "y": 1720, "width": 300, "height": 130, "color": "3", "text": "**FRONTIER 3** — Branch C (BC_C_L_rho_k_per_label)\nL_{ρ,k} family decision **OR** K_∞ Mellin kernel data\n*decides the terminal Branch C matrix-element gate*" },
    { "id": "f4", "type": "text", "x": -240, "y": 1720, "width": 300, "height": 130, "color": "3", "text": "**FRONTIER 4** — Branch C (BC_C_full_ZI_COV_CP)\nfull ZI-COV^CP on whole carrier\n*supplies the step-169 zeta-factorization quotient α_{ℓ,a,Cg}*" },
    { "id": "f5", "type": "text", "x": 180, "y": 1720, "width": 300, "height": 130, "color": "3", "text": "**FRONTIER 5** — Branch C (direct jet-surjectivity)\ndirect projected jet-surjectivity\n**OR** direct structural annihilation,\nwithout replacing P_∞ by ζ-zero spectral projection\n*decides the step-171 target gate*" },
    { "id": "f6", "type": "text", "x": 600, "y": 1720, "width": 300, "height": 130, "color": "3", "text": "**FRONTIER 6** — Hecke (H1–H5)\nadvance Hecke sibling cascade\n*advances Hecke only; transfer to Ξ_BC requires the H6 bridge theorem (not inherited)*" },
    { "id": "f7", "type": "text", "x": 940, "y": 1720, "width": 300, "height": 130, "color": "3", "text": "**FRONTIER 7** — Hecke H6 V-NC bridge\nsupply external congruence bridge\n(carrier / probe / audit / zero-ledger)\n*scalar L-identity alone insufficient*" },

    { "id": "terminus", "type": "text", "x": -200, "y": 1990, "width": 400, "height": 100, "color": "3", "text": "**TRACK TERMINUS (step 172 prior)**\n7 typed external-content gates published\n*superseded by arc terminus node*" },
    { "id": "arc_terminus", "type": "text", "x": -700, "y": 2480, "width": 460, "height": 220, "color": "3", "text": "**📍 ARC TERMINUS (step 200)**\nRH arc 173-200 diagnostic-complete\n4 typed conditions + Bridge Impossibility\n10 retained no-gos; 3 non-CRE native closures\nBranch C + BN numerical experiments\nPath 1 blocked at Burnol κ; Path 2 foreclosed; Path 3 no refuter found" },

    { "id": "ng1", "type": "text", "x": 1700, "y": 100, "width": 400, "height": 100, "color": "1", "text": "**NO-GO: Public-shadow non-promotion**\nforecloses shadow-only attempts on Branch A" },
    { "id": "ng2", "type": "text", "x": 1700, "y": 220, "width": 400, "height": 130, "color": "1", "text": "**NO-GO: Finite-window Calkin blindness**\nforecloses finite-section certificates of either\ncompleted compactness OR positive essential norm /\nnoncompactness on the completed carrier" },
    { "id": "ng3", "type": "text", "x": 1700, "y": 370, "width": 400, "height": 100, "color": "1", "text": "**NO-GO: Auxiliary-GRH smuggling**\nforecloses cheap Hecke-side closure attempts" },
    { "id": "ng4", "type": "text", "x": 1700, "y": 490, "width": 400, "height": 110, "color": "1", "text": "**NO-GO: Incomplete χ-spectrum support-only**\nforecloses partial-coverage Hecke closure" },
    { "id": "ng5", "type": "text", "x": 1700, "y": 620, "width": 400, "height": 130, "color": "1", "text": "**NO-GO: Scalar L-identity ≠ carrier identity**\nL_Q(s,1) = ζ(s) at scalar level does NOT\nidentify Hilbert carriers, probes, Schur residuals" }
